WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,820
When Tieshu called Boss Jin just now

2
00:00:01,820 --> 00:00:03,300
I just guessed it could be you

3
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:04,620
I didn't expect it to be true

4
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:07,940
It was you who did that giant discouragement kill.

5
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,140
Little brother is awesome

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:11,140
It's okay. Mainly because of luck.

7
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:12,140
Not Jianguo

8
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:13,940
Boss Jin, you two know each other?

9
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:15,590
More than just acquaintance

10
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:17,390
I also want to thank this little brother

11
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:19,190
The Ejingteng Lake sent last time

12
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:21,190
It really solved my urgent need.

13
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,590
You also bought it with real money, twenty yuan a pound.

14
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:24,590
What can I say thanks?

15
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:26,190
Ejingteng Lake

16
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,990
Isn't that Buddha's hand?

17
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:30,660
I was convinced that the thing was worthless.

18
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,520
As a result, Boss Jin spent 20 yuan per pound.

19
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:37,060
Bought them all

20
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,860
If I had accepted it then

21
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:42,100
If I sell it to him again

22
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,500
What's going on when I suddenly feel like I can't breathe?

23
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,100
Just now when you didn't come

24
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,100
Boss Tie has already taken me to see the fish.

25
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,900
Things are really fresh

26
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,900
I'm going to entertain some distinguished guests recently

27
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,900
I plan to use this to make a dish worthy of the occasion.

28
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,700
Little brother, let’s see how much it costs

29
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,330
Only then can you give up love

30
00:00:58,330 --> 00:00:59,930
We have cooperated before

31
00:00:59,930 --> 00:01:02,190
I know Boss Jin is a man of judgment.

32
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:03,590
Because say one

33
00:01:03,590 --> 00:01:05,190
The price of this gray sand

34
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:07,190
Actually, Uncle Tie and I are not sure either.

35
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:09,190
Otherwise, he would have collected it himself
